# Not part of the site: internal instructions for whoever works on this
# surface. assets.directory is this dir, so without this line the file is
# served at the surface's public URL.
CLAUDE.md

# assets.directory is this dir, so anything under it is uploaded and served.
# build.mjs caches a 91 MB repo CAR here; it is an input, it is not public, and
# it would blow the asset budget on its own.
word/.cache/

# Same reason: the selftests were being served at silk.mino.mobi/test/*.mjs,
# which nobody wanted and nothing links to. They gate the deploy from the
# workflow's checkout; they are not part of the site. (The engine and the worker
# ARE — the notes link engine.mjs deliberately, so you can read the thing that
# is about to run in your tab.)
test/
